# The Parallel trees are vendored third-party source, frozen at the state that
# was built and validated. core.autocrlf is on for this repository, which would
# otherwise rewrite their line endings on checkout and report every file as
# modified forever -- that churn is what hid a real ten-line Granite fix among
# hundreds of phantom changes while they were still submodules. -text disables
# end-of-line conversion for them entirely, so what is committed is byte for
# byte what the compiler was given.
external/parallel-rdp/** -text
external/parallel-rsp/** -text
